.TH BUDGET 1
.SH NAME
budget \- simple ledger
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/budget
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Budget
is a simple ledger.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Enter date, accounts, amount, and description in a Tk form. Add, delete, save, and load transactions; a view field shows an account balance.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B Add / Delete / Save / Load / Quit buttons
Ledger operations
.TP
.B view account entry
Filter/balance for named account
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH FILES
.TP
.B $home/lib/temple-budget.txt
Preferred.
.TP
.B /tmp/temple-budget.txt
Fallback.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/budget.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR wm (1)
